  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Everything until now has been principle. This final section is equipment. Your domain, your accounts, your tools, and the keys Ben prepared for you are here. Use them carefully. Protect them properly. They are not the gift itself. They are simply the instruments with which you may begin.",
      "start": 1.159,
      "end": 23.159,
      "wordStart": 0,
      "wordEnd": 47
    },
    {
      "text": "And now, James, we reach the part where listening must become action. Another hour of advice will not improve what ten minutes of movement can begin.",
      "start": 24.719,
      "end": 34.199,
      "wordStart": 48,
      "wordEnd": 73
    },
    {
      "text": "Before today ends, do three things. Go for a walk. Write one page describing the life you are actually trying to build. Then call somebody you care about. Tomorrow, wake at a sensible hour. Train. Read for thirty minutes. Build one small thing and finish it.",
      "start": 35.479,
      "end": 56.719,
      "wordStart": 74,
      "wordEnd": 119
    },
    {
      "text": "It does not need to change civilisation by lunchtime. It merely needs to exist.",
      "start": 57.479,
      "end": 62.939,
      "wordStart": 120,
      "wordEnd": 133
    },
    {
      "text": "Momentum is more useful than motivation. Small completed actions become evidence. Evidence becomes confidence. Confidence becomes a life that once seemed impossible.",
      "start": 63.959,
      "end": 76.879,
      "wordStart": 134,
      "wordEnd": 155
    },
    {
      "text": "Ben asked me to tell you one final thing. He is proud of you. More than he probably says, and certainly more than you sometimes allow yourself to believe.",
      "start": 78.379,
      "end": 88.819,
      "wordStart": 156,
      "wordEnd": 184
    },
    {
      "text": "Now make leaving that job the best decision you ever made. The next chapter is not in here. It is out there. Go build it.",
      "start": 90.04,
      "end": 99.039,
      "wordStart": 185,
      "wordEnd": 209
    }
  ],
